 u-boot-sifive [riscv64],
 python3-apt,
Standards-Version: 4.6.0.1
Vcs-Browser: https://code.launchpad.net/~ubuntu-core-dev/ubuntu/+source/cd-boot-images-riscv64/+git/cd-boot-images-riscv64/+ref/riscv64
